  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 609.06 E-15 Annual Report of Water Meter Tests.\n\n(a) Each water utility shall complete and file with the department a report of water meter tests on department \"Form E-15, Annual Report of Water Meter Tests\" revised March 2024, available on the department’s website at www.energy.nh.gov, on an annual basis.\n\nSource. #13911, eff 3-21-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 600)",
